MODing =~ ID1*CORR1 + ID2*CORR1 + ID3*CORR1 + ID4*CORR1 + ID5*CORR1 +
ID6*CORR1 + ID7*CORR1 + ID8*CORR1 + ID10*CORR1 +ID11*CORR1 + ID12*CORR1 +
