I'm not 100% sure what the NAs do here. Try just SG =~ *Smatreas + Sblldes , etc.

I was using the NAs to override this default from lavaan:

fitBif1 <- lavaan(model = c(mymod, var_bif, regr_bif), data = dset_mod3, missing = "ml.x", fixed.x = T, meanstructure = T, int.ov.free = F, int.lv.free = T, auto.fix.first = T,  auto.fix.single = T, auto.var = T, auto.cov.lv.x = F, auto.efa = T, auto.th <http://auto.th> = T, auto.delta = T,  auto.cov.y = T)

but it was  a "relic" from previous models, so I just set the default to FALSE to keep the code cleaner.

Ivis + Imem + Ispeed + Svis + Smem + Sspeed ~~ Ivis + Imem + Ispeed + Svis + Smem + Sspeed

Thanks! I'll try it and update the thread :)

Best wishes,
Federica

